# Main blog & Agent Automations

- **Blog-2.0** (`app/admin/blog-2.0`, `blog-2.0` backend) is Bright CRM / MailerLite — do not mix with this module.
- **Original blog:** `app/admin/blog`, `src/modules/blog`, `src/modules/agents/blog`, `src/modules/agents/automations`.

## Agent memory (automations)

- Stored in blog DB: `blog_agent_guidelines` **id=4**.
- Admin UI: **Blog → Agent Automations → Agent memory**.
- When changing automation behavior (slug from title, SEO, categories, image alt, preview), update memory + `blogAgentAutomationMemory.js` default seed.

## Automation topics

- API: `PUT /api/agents/automations/topics/:id` for edits.
- Topics support `category_ids`; UI must send them on create/update.
- After a run, show `generated_title` (not only post id).

## Agent tools

- `create_blog_post` / `update_blog_post`: slug from title, SEO fields, featured_image_alt/title, categoryIds.
